config BR2_PACKAGE_DOSDRM
	bool "dosdrm"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	help
	  DRM/KMS diagnostic for the fbcon DOS appliance: probe (driver,
	  atomic support, plane scaling limits), fit (pick the connector mode
	  that matches the emulator frame), scale (GPU plane upscale prototype)
	  and bench (framebuffer write cost).

	  Used to verify on the real board whether hardware plane scaling is
	  available; without it the image falls back to CRT mode == frame size
	  so the monitor's scaler does the upscale.
